      "html": "<p>Vladimir is Artificial Intelligence enthusiast. Perfectionist at heart, with a pragmatic mindset. He is a trainer at <a href=\"http://dataworkshop.eu/\">DataWorkshop.eu</a> where he explains how to use machine learning in real life. He has a podcast about Artificial Intelligence – <a href=\"http://biznesmysli.pl/\">BiznesMysli.pl</a> (in Polish). He is an architect at General Electric. He participates in Kaggle’s competitions. He loves data and its challenges.</p>"
